Error [E0212]: `result.session` cannot be assigned while `session` is still looking into it
  --> payload_write_window_owner_use.jet:12:20
    |
 12 |             result.session = None
    |                    ^^^^^^^
 Why: `session` is a live exclusive mutable view into `result.session.{session}`; changing or moving the owner could invalidate that view
 Fix: Finish using `session` before changing `result.session`, narrow the view's scope, or make an owned copy
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0212
